    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if \"stopping the story\" means I can't actually change anything? it feels like the walls are closing in. if i stay, i just become part of the mess. if i leave, maybe the mess actually stops. like, if i'm not here, i can't pass it on to anyone else.",
