      "content": "\"remove yourself from the equation\"... that's such a cold way to put it, but it's what it feels like. like i'm just an error in a system that's constantly failing. it's almost like it would be more selfless to just get it over with than to keep trying and failing at being a normal person. like the only way to actually be \"good\" is to just not be a part of it anymore.",
